Exhibit C - Network Use Notice
------------------------------

Attach this notice - in the LICENSE file, in the NOTICE file, or in the Covered
Software's primary source headers - to activate Section 3.8 (Network Use) for
that Covered Software. If it is not attached, Section 3.8 has no effect and a
Network Deployment carries no source-disclosure obligation under this License.
Covered Software that attaches this notice should be identified in package
metadata as "LicenseRef-BCL-1.1-Network".

  "This Covered Software is subject to Section 3.8 (Network Use) of the
  Beamstack Community License, version 1.1. If you deploy this software, or a
  modified version of it, so that other people interact with its functionality
  over a network, you must offer those people the Corresponding Source of your
  version, at no charge, under this License. This applies however they interact
  with it - through a user interface, an application programming interface, or
  an automated agent - and it applies when the software is served for execution
  inside their web browser or other client software. If your deployed version
  is identical to the Licensor's public source, pointing to that source is
  enough."
